Output pttr.gif
Set Margin 20
Set MarginFill "#3c3c3c"
Set BorderRadius 10

Set FontSize 14
Set Padding 10
Set Width 830
Set Height 566

# Setup
Hide
Type "pttr"
Enter
Show

Sleep 200ms
Down@200ms 4
Sleep 500ms

Type "p"
Sleep 200ms
Down@200ms 4
Sleep 500ms

Type "i"
Sleep 200ms
Down@200ms 4
Sleep 500ms

Type "p"
Sleep 500ms
Type@200ms '/7080'
Down@300ms 1
Sleep 500ms
Type 'k'
Sleep 3s